ands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making Suggestions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You make suggestions to talk about possible things to do.<br/>You use the following expressions with modals to make suggestions:<br/>- You could ...<br/>- You should ...<br/>- You might want to ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: My friends are coming to visit this weekend.<br/><span class = \"strong\">Greg</span>: Great! You could take them to a museum."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Sue</span>: I don't know where to go tonight. What do you suggest?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Drew</span>: You should go to a show. You might want to listen to this new band!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Sue</span>: It's getting cold now. <br/> <span class = \"strong\">Bob</span>: You might want to put on your jacket."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Carol</span>: Why are you wearing a coat? <br/> <span class = \"strong\">Rob</span>: It's cold out. You should wear a coat, too."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dry cleaner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where someone cleans your clothes and fixes them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Where is the dry cleaner? I need to fix this jacket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear about places in a city. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It's getting cold"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the weather is changing from warm to cold"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's getting cold. Can you pass me your jacket?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "It's on the way"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when a place is in the same direction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can bring the jacket to the dry cleaner. It's on the way."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "rip"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tear or cut in a piece of clothing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh no! Look! There's a rip in my jacket!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to fix"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to repair"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The dry cleaner can fix the rip in your jacket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le06ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of interesting places to see in the city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include places for shopping and eating."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue suggesting these places to a tourist. (25-30 words)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe the places you like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the weather and activities."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I identify interesting places in my city."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue suggesting things to tourists."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I describe places in a city."}]}], "type": "sena"}